{"seq":2,"slug":"service-discovery","title":"服务注册与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-discovery","wordCount":1168,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务注册与发现\">服务注册与发现</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在微服务架构中，服务实例的数量和网络地址是动态变化的——实例会因扩缩容、故障恢复而频繁增减。服务发现机制使得调用方无需硬编码服务地址，而是通过注册中心动态获取可用的服务实例列表，实现灵活的服务间通信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务发现要解决&quot;地址在变，调用方如何找到它&quot;，四个概念覆盖了它的全貌：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>客户端发现 vs 服务端发现</strong>：前者由客户端向注册中心查询后直连（少一跳但逻辑重），后者经由负载均衡器转发（客户端简单但多一跳）。</li>\n<li><strong>注册与心跳</strong>：实例启动时注册 (ip, port, metadata)，此后定期心跳续约，心跳超时即被注销——这是&quot;实例列表始终新鲜&quot;的保证。</li>\n<li><strong>注册中心的一致性模型</strong>：CP（ZooKeeper、etcd、Consul）保证列表一致但分区时可能不可用，AP（Eureka、Nacos）始终可读但列表可能短暂滞后。</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查</strong>：从心跳、TCP 探测到 HTTP 端点再到业务检查，精确度递增而开销也递增，需要按服务重要度选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主线：<strong>服务发现的选型本质上是在&quot;列表一致性&quot;与&quot;列表可用性&quot;之间做 CAP 取舍，再用健康检查的粒度决定发现结果的准确性。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务发现模式\">服务发现模式</h2><h3 id=\"客户端发现-vs-服务端发现\">客户端发现 vs 服务端发现</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 客户端发现&#10;    C1[Client] --&gt;|查询| R1[注册中心]&#10;    R1 --&gt;|实例列表| C1&#10;    C1 --&gt;|直连| S1[Service A]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|直连| S2[Service A]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 客户端发现\n    C1[Client] --&gt;|查询| R1[注册中心]\n    R1 --&gt;|实例列表| C1\n    C1 --&gt;|直连| S1[Service A]\n    C1 --&gt;|直连| S2[Service A]\n  end</pre><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 服务端发现&#10;    C2[Client] --&gt;|请求| LB[负载均衡器]&#10;    LB --&gt;|查询| R2[注册中心]&#10;    LB --&gt;|转发| S3[Service A]&#10;    LB --&gt;|转发| S4[Service A]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 服务端发现\n    C2[Client] --&gt;|请求| LB[负载均衡器]\n    LB --&gt;|查询| R2[注册中心]\n    LB --&gt;|转发| S3[Service A]\n    LB --&gt;|转发| S4[Service A]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>负载均衡位置</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户端发现</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>少一跳、灵活</td>\n<td>客户端逻辑重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端发现</td>\n<td>负载均衡器</td>\n<td>客户端简单</td>\n<td>多一跳、LB 是瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"注册中心\">注册中心</h2><h3 id=\"注册与心跳\">注册与心跳</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant S as Service Instance&#10;  participant R as Registry&#10;&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;R: 注册 (ip, port, metadata)&#10;  R--&gt;&gt;S: 注册成功&#10;  loop 每隔 N 秒&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;R: 心跳续约&#10;    R--&gt;&gt;S: OK&#10;  end&#10;  Note over R: 心跳超时 → 注销实例\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant S as Service Instance\n  participant R as Registry\n\n  S-&gt;&gt;R: 注册 (ip, port, metadata)\n  R--&gt;&gt;S: 注册成功\n  loop 每隔 N 秒\n    S-&gt;&gt;R: 心跳续约\n    R--&gt;&gt;S: OK\n  end\n  Note over R: 心跳超时 → 注销实例</pre><h3 id=\"主流注册中心对比\">主流注册中心对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注册中心</th>\n<th>一致性模型</th>\n<th>健康检查</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ZooKeeper</td>\n<td>CP</td>\n<td>临时节点+会话</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>Java 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd</td>\n<td>CP (Raft)</td>\n<td>Lease + TTL</td>\n<td>gRPC/HTTP</td>\n<td>Kubernetes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consul</td>\n<td>CP (Raft)</td>\n<td>多种检查方式</td>\n<td>HTTP/DNS</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eureka</td>\n<td>AP</td>\n<td>心跳续约</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>Spring Cloud</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nacos</td>\n<td>CP+AP 可切换</td>\n<td>心跳/TCP 探测</td>\n<td>HTTP/gRPC</td>\n<td>阿里生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-服务发现\">Kubernetes 服务发现</h2><p>Kubernetes 内置了服务发现机制，不依赖外部注册中心：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P1[Pod 1] --&gt; S[Service&lt;br/&gt;ClusterIP]&#10;  P2[Pod 2] --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt; E[Endpoints]&#10;  E --&gt; P3[Pod 3: app=order]&#10;  E --&gt; P4[Pod 4: app=order]\">graph TD\n  P1[Pod 1] --&gt; S[Service&lt;br/&gt;ClusterIP]\n  P2[Pod 2] --&gt; S\n  S --&gt; E[Endpoints]\n  E --&gt; P3[Pod 3: app=order]\n  E --&gt; P4[Pod 4: app=order]</pre><h3 id=\"发现方式\">发现方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DNS</td>\n<td>通过服务名解析为 ClusterIP</td>\n<td>order-svc.ns.svc.cluster.local</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变量</td>\n<td>注入服务的 IP 和端口</td>\n<td>ORDER_SVC_HOST=10.0.0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Headless Service</td>\n<td>DNS 直接返回 Pod IP 列表</td>\n<td>用于 StatefulSet</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-service&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: order&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 8080&#10;  type: ClusterIP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterIP</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"负载均衡策略\">负载均衡策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轮询</td>\n<td>依次分配请求</td>\n<td>实例性能均等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权轮询</td>\n<td>按权重分配</td>\n<td>实例性能不等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机</td>\n<td>随机选择实例</td>\n<td>简单场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最少连接</td>\n<td>选择活跃连接数最少的实例</td>\n<td>长连接场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性哈希</td>\n<td>相同 key 路由到相同实例</td>\n<td>有状态/缓存场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import random&#10;&#10;class WeightedRoundRobin:&#10;    def __init__(self, instances):&#10;        self.instances = instances&#10;        self.weights = [inst.weight for inst in instances]&#10;        self.current_weights = [0] * len(instances)&#10;&#10;    def next(self):&#10;        total = sum(self.weights)&#10;        max_idx = 0&#10;        for i in range(len(self.instances)):&#10;            self.current_weights[i] += self.weights[i]&#10;            if self.current_weights[i] &gt; self.current_weights[max_idx]:&#10;                max_idx = i&#10;        self.current_weights[max_idx] -= total&#10;        return self.instances[max_idx]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WeightedRoundRobin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, instances):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.instances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [inst.weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.current_weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instances)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        max_idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.instances)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.current_weights[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.current_weights[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.current_weights[max_idx]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                max_idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.current_weights[max_idx] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.instances[max_idx]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"健康检查\">健康检查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查类型</th>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>心跳</td>\n<td>定期发送存活信号</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP 探测</td>\n<td>端口是否可连接</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 探测</td>\n<td>健康端点返回 200</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务检查</td>\n<td>执行实际业务逻辑</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from fastapi import FastAPI&#10;&#10;app = FastAPI()&#10;&#10;@app.get(&quot;/health&quot;)&#10;def health_check():&#10;    db_ok = check_database()&#10;    cache_ok = check_cache()&#10;    return {&#10;        &quot;status&quot;: &quot;healthy&quot; if db_ok and cache_ok else &quot;degraded&quot;,&#10;        &quot;checks&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;database&quot;: &quot;up&quot; if db_ok else &quot;down&quot;,&#10;            &quot;cache&quot;: &quot;up&quot; if cache_ok else &quot;down&quot;,&#10;        }&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fastapi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FastAPI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FastAPI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@app.get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> health_check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> check_database()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cache_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> check_cache()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"healthy\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"degraded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"checks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"up\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"down\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"up\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"down\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务网格-service-mesh\">服务网格（Service Mesh）</h2><p>服务网格通过 Sidecar 代理将服务发现、负载均衡、熔断等功能从应用代码中解耦：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph Pod A&#10;    A[App A] --&gt; PA[Envoy Proxy]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph Pod B&#10;    PB[Envoy Proxy] --&gt; B[App B]&#10;  end&#10;  PA --&gt;|mTLS| PB&#10;  CP[Control Plane&lt;br/&gt;Istio/Linkerd] --&gt;|配置下发| PA&#10;  CP --&gt;|配置下发| PB\">graph LR\n  subgraph Pod A\n    A[App A] --&gt; PA[Envoy Proxy]\n  end\n  subgraph Pod B\n    PB[Envoy Proxy] --&gt; B[App B]\n  end\n  PA --&gt;|mTLS| PB\n  CP[Control Plane&lt;br/&gt;Istio/Linkerd] --&gt;|配置下发| PA\n  CP --&gt;|配置下发| PB</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sidecar 代理</td>\n<td>拦截流量、负载均衡、熔断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制平面</td>\n<td>配置管理、证书分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据平面</td>\n<td>所有 Sidecar 代理的集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>Kubernetes 环境优先使用内置的 Service + DNS 机制</li>\n<li>非 K8s 环境推荐 Consul 或 Nacos，支持多语言和多种健康检查</li>\n<li>客户端发现搭配连接池和重试逻辑，性能优于服务端发现</li>\n<li>健康检查应包含核心依赖（数据库、缓存）的探测</li>\n<li>大规模微服务考虑引入服务网格（Istio/Linkerd）统一流量管理</li>\n<li>注册中心选择 CP 还是 AP 取决于业务容忍度——金融场景用 CP，互联网场景用 AP</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>服务发现的核心问题是&quot;地址持续变化时，调用方如何始终拿到新鲜的可用实例列表&quot;。它的两条主线是发现模式与注册中心的一致性选择：客户端发现少一跳但客户端逻辑重，服务端发现简单却多一跳且 LB 可能成为瓶颈；注册中心在 CP（ZooKeeper、etcd、Consul）与 AP（Eureka、Nacos）之间的取舍，本质上就是 CAP 在服务发现场景的复现。Kubernetes 环境优先用内置的 Service + DNS，非 K8s 环境再按多语言、健康检查能力选 Consul 或 Nacos，大规模场景则可引入服务网格统一流量管理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服务注册与发现","id":"服务注册与发现"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"服务发现模式","id":"服务发现模式"},{"level":3,"text":"客户端发现 vs 服务端发现","id":"客户端发现-vs-服务端发现"},{"level":2,"text":"注册中心","id":"注册中心"},{"level":3,"text":"注册与心跳","id":"注册与心跳"},{"level":3,"text":"主流注册中心对比","id":"主流注册中心对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 服务发现","id":"kubernetes-服务发现"},{"level":3,"text":"发现方式","id":"发现方式"},{"level":2,"text":"负载均衡策略","id":"负载均衡策略"},{"level":2,"text":"健康检查","id":"健康检查"},{"level":2,"text":"服务网格（Service Mesh）","id":"服务网格-service-mesh"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务拆分与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-decomposition"},"next":{"title":"API 网关与 BFF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/api-gateway"}}